<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Sasani says still discussing acquisitions.</title>
<headline>Sasani says still discussing acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sasani Ltd said on Friday it was still in talks about acquisitions which could have an impact on its share price and urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
